Z||000007||banditbalz||12-30-2001||05:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 4BanGinFun:<BR><B>ok we have a 85 fiero se 2m4 5spd and theres a 4 banger stang around that year 5 spd who would win?? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Okay, let's see... the Mustang is a heavier car, has a smaller engine (2.3 vs. 2.5) and less horsepower. hmmm...<P>In college I had a friend with a 4 cyl. Mustang and just like Blackstang, he thought it was the fastest thing on 4 wheels. Needless to say, we lined my '82 VW Rabit (1.7 w/4 speed) up to the stang at a set of lights where i proceeded to embaress him. At 80km/h, he couldn't read my plate number any more! The funny thing is, my friend used to call his own Stang, "The gutless wonder"||||reg||1
